From: wannaknowhys <heyusu@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 19:56:52 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] M2-C2b4 b4-3 arena-clone: reach rc=0 on device domain
 (env STREAM_MOE_ARENA gated, default CPU green). Root causes fixed: (1)
 whole-layer clone DAG overflows llama graph ctx -> dedicated no_alloc scratch
 ggml_context (16MB, RAII free); (2) plan-time ri.src data goes stale when
 llama re-wraps inputs between build and sched compute -> resolve external
 input data from EXECUTION-time main-graph nd->src[s], plan keeps structure
 only. 30 layers run arena-clone vulkan whole-layer cgraph without crash but
 numerics still wrong (embd cos 0.217) - recorded isolation checklist for next
 session (moe_out readback target, VIEW-strided weighted-slice srcs on GPU,
 down-mm arena-cur, anonymous-add dependency order). RAM IDENTICAL

---
 docs/WORK_IN_PROGRESS.md       |   9 ++-
 src/backend/minigraph_exec.cpp | 118 ++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 2 files changed, 93 insertions(+), 34 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docs/WORK_IN_PROGRESS.md b/docs/WORK_IN_PROGRESS.md
